Type":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A member of Mudrock's Sarkaz squad. Integrating Sarkaz tactics with Leithanian Arts to greater effect, they are capable of inflicting lethal damage with a block of energy, and prioritize attacking units closest to the contract entrance site.","abilities":["Prioritizes attacking units that are vying for control of a 'Gramophone.'","Attacks 2 targets simultaneously"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":500,"def":500,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.6}},"playwright":{"slug":"playwright","name":"'Playwright'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Playwright'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A nameless youth toiling behind the scenes, he has never stopped writing, even when he lacks pen and paper. Someone here is worthy of his interest, and he doesn't seem hostile.","abilities":["Deals area damage to Operators on the four cardinal tiles next to the primary target.","Periodically attacks all allied units on the field","Periodically uses Arts to greatly reduce an allied unit's ASPD and deal Arts damage to that unit every second. If Operators under this effect leave the field, the tile they are on will be permanently sealed and cannot be deployed on","When HP drops below half, gains greatly increased DEF and RES, and uses skills more often"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":80000,"atk":700,"def":1000,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"troupe_mouthpiece":{"slug":"troupe_mouthpiece","name":"'Troupe Mouthpiece'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Troupe Mouthpiece'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"The host of the Grand Drama, its mind is completely taken up by its dazzling Arts. The moment it abandoned the Witch King, its curse was deeply etched into the betrayer's spirit. Even so, who cares?","abilities":["Permanently Invulnerable","Attacks 2 enemies simultaneously and inflicts extra Nervous Impairment","Controls <Host's Assistants> in combat. <Host's Assistants> reduce the ATK of and deal continuous True damage to nearby allied units","Loses HP whenever a <Host's Assistant> is killed"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":100000,"atk":900,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"big_sad_lock":{"slug":"big_sad_lock","name":"Big Sad Lock","icon":"/enemies-icons/Big Sad Lock.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"One of the works of the troupe's host, it isn't very well received amongst the troupe. They do not recognize the stiff manipulation of a puppet as a kind of art, and its rough approach to things is constantly criticized by other members.","abilities":["Attacks 2 enemies simultaneously","Has high endurance and powerful recovery abilities, and enemies continuously appear when on the field","Periodically casts a Barrier to protect itself. While the Barrier is active, it does not attack, but all enemies' movement speed increases and additional enemies appear.","After receiving a certain number of hits, deals Arts damage to all allied units","Drains 30 Life Points when a long time has passed in the battle"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.1,"stats":{"hp":150000,"atk":600,"def":700,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"nameless_elite_knight":{"slug":"nameless_elite_knight","name":"Nameless Elite Knight","icon":"/enemies-icons/Nameless Elite Knight.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An indepen